{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:232","content":{"id":232,"title":"29 化学战：干扰素，干扰起来！","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d23dfb5f-99bd-451f-a806-5f4231798689","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人体细胞抵抗入侵病毒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"01cc4cbb-1a5a-4645-928f-72f4be318094","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一步，细胞要意识到自己受到了袭击，Toll 样可以识别病毒一类敌人的最常见形状，上皮细胞有一些不同的受体，可以扫描自己内部，看看有没有危险信号。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"823b0afe-5289-4c0b-9da7-ec45dd03397d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先天性免疫系统对付病毒没有对付细菌那么厉害，需要适应性免疫系统的帮助，但是适应性免疫系统反应很慢，需要几天时间才能苏醒，所以先天性免疫系统要争取时间，减慢感染速度，如何做到，发动化学战。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dad52b49-a932-498c-8615-f3c832162368","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞因子是激活并指挥免疫系统的分子，当细胞发现自己被感染时，它会想周围的细胞核免疫系统释放一系列细胞因子，其中有一类很特殊，干扰素，它是干扰病毒的细胞因子。细胞接收到干扰素，就会令细胞活动发生剧变，第一批剧变，暂停蛋白的生产，这样在被感染的情况下也不会合成大量病毒蛋白。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ea8dccda-7512-4762-a14e-e7dbc8e46675","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞可以生成几十种干扰素，有很多针对性干扰病毒的例子，这些不重要，重要的是干扰素可以干扰病毒复制的每一步。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e26a4dae-4f14-4d1e-8b93-1af79f85c66d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但有些病毒如甲型流感病毒适应了人类的免疫系统，它会生成一些攻击蛋白，摧毁和阻断感染细胞的内部防御机制，虽然并不总能阻止细胞释放干扰素，但是可以给自己争取时间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b01c5dd2-a15e-4c1f-9137-cef338920818","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浆细胞树突状细胞（pDC），随血液流动或驻扎淋巴网络，专门扫描病毒特征（干扰素或者病毒颗粒），一旦发现病毒痕迹，就会活化，释放大量干扰素，是免疫系统活化做好战斗准备。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"48ffc9c4-5003-4780-be2f-e4498caade94","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当免疫细胞意识到面对的是病毒感染，就会释放另一组细胞因子，热原质。热原质就是引起发热的化学物质，发热会形成不利于病原体的生活环境，同时让免疫细胞更有利的战斗。热原质进入脑内，会和神经细胞发生作用，改变人体的恒温设定，从而升高体温。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31a8158f-caf7-47ab-83a0-d44af5df40ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两种方式升高体温："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"7421abda-0760-468b-a66d-34304ac75186","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ee991b6f-98e7-41d3-8bbb-2aa341694066","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"05da30e2-7ccc-4c6e-8404-bd8e4b6c94c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让人打寒战，肌肉快速收缩，同时产生热作为副作用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bb8a6667-8375-482c-ac52-8274420062b5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d2ab686-478c-4827-b975-eb37261c7609","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让体表血管收缩，减少热量散失"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dd348f42-2fff-4991-95b9-6099a68f99b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以发热时会感觉很冷。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ea43cecf-ef25-45be-99e7-9fcba16f71e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"免疫细胞可以耐受升高的体温，甚至高温常会加快某些蛋白的反应，而病毒很难适应升高的温度，可以直接减缓病毒和细菌的增殖。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"829d18cc-c2ee-4901-b734-e6416defc165","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"流感和普通感冒的区别："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f3e936d3-d7b0-4ddf-9156-a0174a615874","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6bac70a1-2f7f-4aa7-98f6-07e176340f28","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86f076c3-96be-4a6b-bd22-e27fe954734c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"流感属于急性病毒性上呼吸道感染，得流感的时候，发热等其他症状大批袭来，头疼，无法思考，甚至会浑身疼痛，让人难受"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fe4ae943-7190-4a41-866e-dd6f7f74fcfa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"370b2c28-3625-48b5-ba82-48131c1c5780","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"普通赶跑，健康成年人一年可能得 2-5 次，小孩一年可能得 7 次，大体上无甚危害，可能都察觉不到"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"29 化学战：干扰素，干扰起来！","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:232","type":"doc","id":232}}],"prevPage":{"title":"28 流感——威力被低估的病毒","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:231","type":"doc","id":231}},"nextPage":{"title":"30 细胞之窗","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:236","type":"doc","id":236}},"createTime":1741736178589,"updateTime":1743303640527,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640527}}